description=05:00 IST camera snap. Installs scripts + crond. Not an LSPosed hook. Daily decision is IST-checked in watch.sh, never a cron hour. v1.2: retry cap, retry window, battery floor, one-snap-per-day sent guard, PIN self-heal, crond watchdog.
